  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "题目描述",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>请从小到大输出 <span class=\"katex math inline\">1 \\sim n</span> 中所有个位为 <span class=\"katex math inline\">5</span> 或者个位为<span class=\"katex math inline\">8</span> 的所有的整数，每行 <span class=\"katex math inline\">1</span> 个。</p>\n<p>比如，假设 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n=20</span>，那么满足条件的数输出如下：</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">5</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">8</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">15</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">18</span></p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "请从小到大输出 1 \\sim n 中所有个位为 5 或者个位为8 的所有的整数，每行 1 个。\n比如，假设 n=20，那么满足条件的数输出如下：\n5\n8\n15\n18"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输入",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>一个整数 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span> 。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "一个整数 n 。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输出",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p><span class=\"katex math inline\">1 \\sim n</span> 中所有满足条件的整数。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "1 \\sim n 中所有满足条件的整数。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "样例",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"sample-test\">\n                        <div class=\"input\">\n                            <h4>输入</h4>\n                            <pre>25</pre>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"output\">\n                            <h4>输出</h4>\n                            <pre>5\r\n8\r\n15\r\n18\r\n25</pre>\n                        </div>\n\n                                                    <div class=\"input\">\n                                <h4>输入</h4>\n                                <pre>30</pre>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"output\">\n                                <h4>输出</h4>\n                                <pre>5\r\n8\r\n15\r\n18\r\n25\r\n28</pre>\n                            </div>\n                        \n                                                    <div class=\"input\">\n                                <h4>输入</h4>\n                                <pre>20</pre>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"output\">\n                                <h4>输出</h4>\n                                <pre>5\r\n8\r\n15\r\n18</pre>\n                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                </div>",
      "text": "输入\n                            25\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            5\r\n8\r\n15\r\n18\r\n25\n                        \n\n                                                    \n                                输入\n                                30\n                            \n                            \n                                输出\n                                5\r\n8\r\n15\r\n18\r\n25\r\n28\n                            \n                        \n                                                    \n                                输入\n                                20\n                            \n                            \n                                输出\n                                5\r\n8\r\n15\r\n18"
